	(text "Colpitts Resonator Tank Circuit\nf = 1/(2pi * sqrt(L * Ceq))\nCeq = C1*C2/(C1+C2) = 50pF\nf ~ 2.25 MHz  (L=100uH, C1=C2=100pF)\n\nJ1: frequency measurement (Out vs GND)\nJ2: capacitance measurement (Mid vs GND)"
